tion\n- Full system test coverage\n- Detailed documentation\n- Performance report\n\n## Dependencies\n1. Milestone 1 must complete before Milestone 2\n2. Milestone 2 must complete before Milestone 3\n3. All milestones require continuous integration support\n\n## Success Criteria\n- ✓ No memory leaks\n- ✓ Configurable retention policies\n- ✓ Minimal performance overhead\n- ✓ Complete test coverage\n- ✓ Backward compatibility maintained'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01Y17VS2kbHsauoqipNcEVsr', 'content': '{"success": true, "message": "File written successfully to /Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/milestone_plan.md (backup: /Users/mattbillock/.ensemble/backups/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/milestone_plan_20260115_014723.md)", "backup_path": "/Users/mattbillock/.ensemble/backups/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/milestone_plan_20260115_014723.md", "was_overwrite": true}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01V2YKpAZWbJ2eAkBtbt3sLs', 'name': 'spawn_agent', 'input': {'agent_type': 'coordinators/backend_coordinator', 'input_data': {'milestone': 'Filtering and Basic Cleanup Foundation', 'architecture': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/architecture.md', 'requirements': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/requirements.md', 'output_file': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/backend_tasks_m1.md', 'target_file': 'src/runtime/agents/activity_tracker.py'}}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01V2YKpAZWbJ2eAkBtbt3sLs', 'content': '{"success": true, "result": {"status": "success", "tasks_identified": 10, "task_file": "/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/backend_tasks_m1.md", "dependencies": ["Task 1 \\u2192 Task 2 \\u2