{"timestamp": "2026-01-15 02:01:25", "level": "DEBUG", "module": "anthropic._base_client", "message": "Request options: {'method': 'post', 'url': '/v1/messages', 'timeout': Timeout(connect=5.0, read=600, write=600, pool=600), 'files': None, 'idempotency_key': 'stainless-python-retry-ecac0f6b-338a-4ee6-8600-0d943669a4aa', 'json_data': {'max_tokens': 4096, 'messages': [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'Please complete the following task:\n\n{\n  "user_vision": "Fix the incomplete request cleanup system causing memory growth issues.\\n\\nCONTEXT:\\n- The clear_request() method in ActivityTracker is incomplete\\n- Request filtering is not implemented\\n- Activities accumulate without cleanup, causing memory issues\\n- See: docs/current/V1_CLEANUP_ISSUES.md lines 79-92\\n\\nREQUIREMENTS:\\n1. Complete the clear_request() implementation\\n2. Implement request-based activity filtering\\n3. Add cleanup mechanism for old activities (configurable retention)\\n4. Ensure no data loss for active requests\\n\\nACCEPTANCE CRITERIA:\\n- clear_request() fully removes request data\\n- Activities can be filtered by request_id\\n- Old activities are cleaned up automatically\\n- Memory usage remains stable over long sessions\\n- Existing functionality unaffected\\n\\nFILES TO MODIFY:\\n- src/runtime/agents/activity_tracker.py\\n- Related test files\\n\\nTDD APPROACH: Write failing tests first, then implement.",\n  "output_directory": "/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output",\n  "context": "User submitted problem via web UI"\n}\n\nRemember to respond with valid JSON matching the expected output format.\n'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01MgbYN45LrcUXxFkvhf4DwU', 'name': 'project_tracking', 'input': {'action': 'create_project', 'project_name': 'Activity Tracker Cleanup System', 'description': 'Implement complete request cleanup mechanism in activity tracker to resolve memory growth issues'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01MgbYN45LrcUXxFkvhf4DwU', 'content': '{"success": true, "project_id": "aae383c3", "message": "Created project: Activity Tracker Cleanup System", "summary": {"project_id": "aae383c3", "project_name": "Activity Tracker Cleanup System", "description": "Implement complete request cleanup mechanism in activity tracker to resolve memory growth issues", "status": "active", "created_at": "2026-01-15T02:01:11.902053", "updated_at": "2026-01-15T02:01:11.902053", "task_counts": {"total": 0, "todo": 0, "in_progress": 0, "completed": 0, "blocked": 0, "cancelled": 0}, "completion_percentage": 0.0, "recent_notes": [{"timestamp": "2026-01-15T02:01:11.902053", "author": "executive_director", "note": "Project \'Activity Tracker Cleanup System\' created", "category": "milestone"}], "output_directory": null}}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01PJs6bf5EH2GhiZ2tnYH46g', 'name': 'project_tracking', 'input': {'action': 'add_task', 'project_id': 'aae383c3', 'description': 'Implement complete request cleanup mechanism for Activity Tracker', 'assigned_to': 'development_manager'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01PJs6bf5EH2GhiZ2tnYH46g', 'content': '{"success": true, "task_id": "3a6a78c8", "message": "Added task: Implement complete request cleanup mechanism for Activity Tracker"}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01DTq8HLqKzW534JHHqbBo8c', 'name': 'write_file', 'input': {'file_path': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/requirements.md', 'content': '# Activity Tracker Cleanup System Requirements\n\n## Problem Statement\nMemory growth issues in the request cleanup system due to incomplete implementation of clear_request() and lack of activity filtering.\n\n## Objectives\n1. Complete the clear_request() method in ActivityTracker\n2. Implement request-based activity filtering\n3. Add configurable activity retention and cleanup mechanism\n4. Prevent memory leaks during long-running sessions\n\n## Detailed Requirements\n### 1. Request Cleanup\n- Fully remove request-specific data when clear_request() is called\n- Ensure no orphaned data remains after cleanup\n- Preserve data for active requests\n\n### 2. Activity Filtering\n- Enable filtering activities by request_id\n- Support complex filter conditions (date, status, type)\n- Minimal performance overhead\n\n### 3. Retention Mechanism\n- Configurable retention period for activities\n- Automatic cleanup of old activities\n- Configurable retention policies (time-based, count-based)\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- ✓ clear_request() removes all associated request data\n- ✓ Activities can be filtered by request_id\n- ✓ Old activities automatically cleaned up\n- ✓ Memory usage remains stable\n- ✓ No impact on existing system functionality\n\n## Files to Modify\n- src/runtime/agents/activity_tracker.py\n- Related test files in test/ directory\n\n## Constraints\n- Use TDD approach: Write tests first, then implementation\n- Maintain existing API contract\n- Minimal performance impact\n- No data loss for active requests\n\n## Assumptions\n- Retention configuration will be handled via configuration file\n- Default retention period of 30 days for inactive requests\n- Cleanup process runs periodically in background\n\n## Out of Scope\n- Complete rewrite of activity tracking system\n- Changes to core logging mechanisms\n- Performance optimizations beyond cleanup\n\n## Risks\n- Potential data loss if cleanup logic is incorrect\n- Performance overhead from filtering/cleanup\n- Compatibility with existing integrations'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01DTq8HLqKzW534JHHqbBo8c', 'content': '{"success": true, "message": "File written successfully to /Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/requirements.md (backup